  "predecessor_review": "PG647 leaves seven K139 lexical domains Open. PG618 already pins Kāśikā 5.4.139 and exact gopadī membership, but membership alone did not interpret the first member or supply a case token. Rāmāyaṇa 5.22.34 supplies a cow-footed feminine referent and ACCsg token. Short gopadīṃ and long gopādīṃ witnesses remain two readings; no forced normalization or critical priority.",
